.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 
How a window should open\&. 

Zero every field first, then set the ones that matter\&. A zeroed struct asks for an 800x600 window named 'Schultz' with vertical sync on and no debug tint, which is a working choice rather than a broken one\&. 
.PP
